st for my  personalities when I decide I'm gonna do  something I just go all in and so  whether it's the film or whatever I'm  going to do it's like if I decide I'm  going to do that then yeah I'm gonna  have to dive in and figure it out and  take on every aspect of it to kind of  piece it together  and I bet there's so many elements that  cross over between being a magician and  film  because your sleight of hand of so many  things for sure and that was actually  one aspect I worked into that first  feature there was this little Side Story  with uh him learning magic from his  grandfather that had been kind of  separated from the family and teaching  and doing magic at the hospital where he  was being treated you know  um which sounds like kind of a sappy  store but actually I was doing that at  that same time I was a magician I would  go to these hospitals sometimes and do  magic and so I was able to kind of take  that kind of story from my own life and  yeah you know I think I I think magic  and film is very similar because it's  it's both kind of creating this illusion  or whatever  um and I just love nothing more than  being able to whether it was doing a  magic trick back then which I don't do  anymore or uh film magic trick or  whatever but making somebody feel  something that that's really where I I  guess I can get off or whatever you want  to call it like basically uh you know  witnessing someone  uh have a reaction to something you've  you've created I just think is so  amazing and so if you can do that  um in whatever form uh it's just it's so  so exciting to me so yeah
 

